@startuml
title MyNetMate - Network Management components\nbackend main @ 166e2ee | selected internal contracts | no cross-branch assembly
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam padding 10
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7FBFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #315A78
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
component "Network Management" as NetworkSystem {
 component "devices : DeviceManagement" as Devices {
  portout " " as R_N01
  portout " " as P_N02
 }
 component "collection : NetworkCollection" as Collection {
  portin " " as R_N02
  portout " " as R_N03
  portout " " as R_N04
  portin " " as P_N01
 }
 component "collector : InventoryCollection" as Collector {
  portout " " as R_N05
  portin " " as P_N03
  note "InventoryCollector.collect()\ncollector.py" as CollectorImplementation
 }
 component "oxian : OxianPython" as Oxian {
  portin " " as P_N04
  portin " " as P_N05
 }
 R_N01 -(0- P_N01 : N01: ITargetCollection
 R_N02 -(0- P_N02 : N02: ISnapshotApplication
 R_N03 -(0- P_N03 : N03: IInventoryCollection
 R_N04 -(0- P_N04 : N04: IOxianDiscovery
 R_N05 -(0- P_N05 : N05: ISnmpClient
}
legend bottom left
 Square = UML Port (name suppressed). Socket = required; ball = provided.
 Each assembly joins two simple ports for ONE named interface.
 role : ComponentType denotes a part; types are logical software-module abstractions.
 Contract IDs map to operations and immutable source evidence in README / CONTRACTS.md.
 Both directions between Devices and Collection are real service contracts, not request/response arrows.
 HTTP routes, SQLAlchemy sessions and health/topology internals are deliberately omitted.
 Discovery is permitted only in an isolated lab; this work performed no network or device I/O.
endlegend
@enduml
